{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "二人の話者の視野と選択率、裸名詞の曖昧さを読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-89cc55", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-7311f7", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "選択者を分母とする遡及選択、後続テストの順序と理由を読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-efee87", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-709996", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "情報源の識別と借用を分け、全体と部分群・指標の差を本文と付録で読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-a06a73", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-5b8a7c", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "4歳児・3歳児、自由回答・強制選択、事前登録再実験と中立条件の不在を読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-9e79b5", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-d231f8", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "名目群の合算方法、共同想起における正答・作話の両方の減少を読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-159ddb", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-221a66", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "中間共同記憶試験と後続個人判断の差、最終記憶試験の順序を読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-a7b1c0", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-7e6b25", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "社会的出所記憶の予測と実測の差、予測評定の反応性を読んだ。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-a4a920", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "MAT-20261122-734925", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "記録形式と下流拘束の区別を読み、原典との整合を限定的に評価した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-e8380b", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "HYP-20261122-f38498", "type": "hypothesis"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "経路付け替え・遡及信用移転の対立仮説を読み、人間研究とは直接識別できないと保留した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-6f6b2d", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "HYP-20261122-970bed", "type": "hypothesis"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "訂正の存在と利用の区別、および評価の質量移転に関する先行判断を継承した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-4df6c0", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "NOTE-20261122-09d213", "type": "note"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "機能的対応は二説を識別しないことと、通常の重みが相対値を変えることを検算した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-8c148d", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "EVL-20261122-49d578", "type": "evaluation"}}
{"created_at": "2026-11-22", "note": "非識別の支持が優劣として計算されないよう、評価の重みを無効化した訂正を確認した。", "read_id": "READ-20261122-ddbd03", "reading": "interpreted", "session_id": "SESSION-20261122-06c898", "target": {"id": "ERR-20261122-c7c642", "type": "erratum"}}
